Description: Linux security automation: scanning, hardening, and rollback
 Linux System Hardener automates security through comprehensive scanning,
 automated hardening, and safe rollback across 8 security domains (kernel,
 SSH, firewall, PAM, audit, MAC, permissions, services) with full
 multi-distribution support and compliance reporting.
